EXP1 – Text-to-SQL Workflow

This experiment develops an LLM-based Text-to-SQL system that converts natural language questions into SQL queries. The generated SQL query is executed on a SQLite database, and the results are displayed to the user.

Technologies: Python, SQLite, Ollama, Llama 3.2, SQL

Workflow:

User Question → Ollama LLM → SQL Query → SQLite Database → Result

Example:

User: "Show all students who scored more than 85."

SELECT * FROM students WHERE marks > 85;

The query is then executed on the database and the matching student records are displayed.
